exports[`prompt texts > networkRule 1`] = `
"Your shell commands reach any website except a few closed ones (tunnels, paste and file-drop sites, request catchers). A site a command could not reach because it is not allowed is closed for this project on purpose: do not try it again another way, and never ask the person to open it. Use an official package registry or what is already in this copy, or go on without it and say in your answer what is missing.

──── next call ────

Your shell commands reach only the official package and download sites of common tools and this project's own sites. A site a command could not reach because it is not allowed is closed for this project on purpose: do not try it again another way, and never ask the person to open it. Use an official package registry or what is already in this copy, or go on without it and say in your answer what is missing.

──── next call ────

Your shell commands reach no website at all, only this computer. A site a command could not reach because it is not allowed is closed for this project on purpose: do not try it again another way, and never ask the person to open it. Use what is already installed and in this copy, or go on without it and say in your answer what is missing."
`;

